Move-Master.OS

Dispatch Intelligence for Real-World Operations

Currently in private preview

Move-Master.OS is an operational intelligence system for moving and fleet-based businesses that need clarity during the day, not explanations after it’s over.

This is not another scheduling app.
It’s the system that shows you what’s actually happening.

⸻

Why It Exists

Most operations tools assume the plan survives contact with reality.

It doesn’t.

Jobs shift.
Drivers rotate.
Receipts show up late.
Costs change mid-day.

Move-Master.OS was built for that gap, the space between what was scheduled and what actually occurred.

⸻

What You’ll See Immediately
	•	A live operational view of each day
	•	Jobs, receipts, drivers, trucks, and outcomes connected in one place
	•	Real-time revenue, expenses, and net impact
	•	Dispatch assignments with instant visibility
	•	No manual reconciliation required

When something changes, the system reflects it immediately.

